                                 labelled; Dynamic Type via tokens; Reduce Motion via TSFadeIn / TSSkeleton
  telemetry                    → view.opened surface="FrontendErrorsCard" emitted once on first applied snapshot

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → header over two skeleton bars (web `isLoading`).
  error    → retryable "Unable to load frontend error summary." (web `!data`, upgraded with a Retry per the
             P4 leaf contract); an explicit query errorMessage takes precedence.
  empty    → data resolved with top.length === 0 → header + headline total + "No frontend errors reported in
             the last hour." (web inner empty branch). The surrounding header+headline keep it from ever
             being a blank box.
  data     → header + headline total + the top-offender list (web `top.length > 0`).
  stale    → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → header chip + banner over last-known content; no auto-refresh.

